        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_grapes",
        "LocalizationKey": "herbsfungigrapes_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A bunch of small dark grapes from a wild vine, sweet and a little sour. Eat them, or crush them into water to start a grape must that ferments into wine."
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_grapes",
        "LocalizationKey": "herbsfungigrapes_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Found:</b> Foraging in summer and autumn at the Oak Clearing and the Foraging Path.\n\n<b>Uses:</b> Eat raw. Drag onto a container of water to crush them into Grape Must, which turns into Grape Wine after 4 days. Holding them unlocks Plant Grapes."
    },
